{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"iterativeDeepeningDepthFirstSearch","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Successors","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"from","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"start","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"successors","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Successors","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"until","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isGoal","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]? ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Equatable","preciseIdentifier":"s:SQ","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" == ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Successors","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST7ElementQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Successors","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Runs depth-first searches with a growing depth limit that keep only the current path, so states"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"need only be "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Equatable"},{"type":"text","text":" and memory stays proportional to the path. A path never revisits a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"state on itself. Returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" when no goal is reachable and the space is finite; on an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"infinite space without a goal, it does not return."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With no record of visited states, every path is enumerated again at each depth, which is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"exponential in the depth on graphs with many routes between states (a grid). Use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"breadthFirstSearch(from:successors:)"},{"type":"text","text":" when states are "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Hashable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and memory allows."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Traversal"}],"symbolKind":"func","externalID":"s:9Traversal34iterativeDeepeningDepthFirstSearch4from10successors5untilSayxGSgx_q_xXESbxXEtSQRz7ElementQy_RszSTR_r0_lF","role":"symbol","title":"iterativeDeepeningDepthFirstSearch(from:successors:until:)","remoteSource":{"fileName":"SuccessorFunctionSearch.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Traversal\/SuccessorFunctionSearch.swift#L77"},"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"iterativeDeepeningDepthFirstSearch","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Successors","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"from","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex",